    "summary": "Errata replacing the [Synapse](vsdata:ability/tyranids.synapse) army rule. With a **TYRANIDS** Army Faction, a **TYRANIDS** unit of yours within 6″ of at least 1 friendly **SYNAPSE** model counts as within Synapse Range of both that model and your army. While it is within your army's Synapse Range:\n\n- it rolls 3D6 rather than 2D6 for its Battle-shock tests\n- each melee attack by its models gets +1 Strength",
